            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "pecheleleaw"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I love real french beignets (not the NOreleans style), and Jewish doughnuts are the only thing that tastes closest! My Israeli friend made them for me for Christmas/Hannukah-she swore I would love them and she was right, they were fabulous! Oh, I love them! Thanks Aviv,for the self-rising sub., and Jesusistheway for the lowerfat version, and M. Levy for the recipe! (It is a good way to not throw that not too old yogurt away..)!",
            "datePublished": "2011-02-13T10:07:57.670Z"
          },
          {
